- independent plan-critic: 미실행.
- verifier: 이 report를 입력으로 상위 controller가 실행해야 함.
- plan approval: 미승인.
- design 진입: critic MAJOR 0 + verifier PASS + 회장 `/approve plan` 전 불가.
- eng-design에서 합의할 O-1~O-6: canonical storage/migration, publication transaction, OAuth projection, tenant API token scopes, Midjourney route, video Calendar/Queue representation.

